 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GKH6OhEcKRwQ7kNvwF5vBOi&_nc_oc=Adr4Jl9rWbL7RezzI6FWwh_cwhApplq4lIwfvpmbaR5hhhi2WEkZOpkUdj8rojBciw8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVojxYIpv9UrnQZhLqkR-a8GF4_ECFVw32PtzrHCkJOg&oe=6ACA5741"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5lr_7gBTt4Q7kNvwHjDmGv&_nc_oc=AdoAtvFLi5aLhBBVI3lJkvgeuO2_MgBIlJpBNKpAxXsZurW8N0QhytRFKdcIa-FSNVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN08y5Mb9qpys-8sLJyW9btVi5utJT-KQWlDJ2LcQn6sA&oe=6ACA64A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d2m21T17pbwQ7kNvwE-4kd2&_nc_oc=AdotckwJhBcJV42IbTtE5V_sa34hrBlIOSA_ML-Em-8goSLFJN2nKQEV1E1XXIAwK5g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOFJRQ8veK4OLO1vbXb1CsqHHQDr9ZlQ2M2Xrc5BLYHiA&oe=6ACA6E9C"}, {"fil